      "reasons": [
        "The definition’s first claim (“production of new cells through cell division”) is not explicitly stated anywhere in the provided packet text.",
        "The “adult brain” portion is only partially supported: the packet describes neurogenesis and observed cell proliferation after mating in specific regions (dentate gyrus of the hippocampus, olfactory bulbs, and smaller amounts in preoptic area and amygdala), but it does not support the phrasing “increase in newly formed cells seen in areas where neurogenesis can occur” as a general summary.",
